{
  "id": "notes-api-port",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Kodu değiştirmeden port değiştirmek",
    "en": "Changing the port without changing the code"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "docker",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "compose.yaml",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": ".env",
      "starter": "starter-env",
      "solution": "solution-env"
    },
    {
      "name": "compose.yaml",
      "starter": "starter-compose.yaml",
      "solution": "solution-compose.yaml"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dockerfile",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "app.py",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "healthcheck.py",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "requirements.txt",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": ".dockerignore",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 180,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`.env`: `PORT=9000`; `compose.yaml`: `\"8095:9000\"`.",
      "en": "`.env`: `PORT=9000`; `compose.yaml`: `\"8095:9000\"`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**.env**\n\n```text\nDB_PATH=/data/notes.db\nPORT=9000\n```\n\n**compose.yaml**\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  web:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"8095:9000\"\n    env_file: .env\n    volumes:\n      - notes-data:/data\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  notes-data:\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**.env**\n\n```text\nDB_PATH=/data/notes.db\nPORT=9000\n```\n\n**compose.yaml**\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  web:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"8095:9000\"\n    env_file: .env\n    volumes:\n      - notes-data:/data\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  notes-data:\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "compose",
      "service": "web",
      "ports": [
        "8095:9000"
      ],
      "env_file": true
    },
    {
      "type": "compose_up",
      "running": [
        "web"
      ],
      "healthy": [
        "web"
      ],
      "wait": 60,
      "http": [
        {
          "service": "web",
          "port": 9000,
          "path": "/health",
          "json": {
            "status": "ok"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
